 "section_summary": "This section contains documentation compiled by SCAP's Civil Information and Education Section regarding educational institutions in Japan during 1946, forwarded to the U.S. State Department in 1948. It concludes a statistical roster for Kagawa Prefecture detailing village elementary schools, kindergartens, private institutions, and schools administered by non-educational ministries. A July 1948 transmittal despatch from the U.S. Political Adviser in Tokyo then introduces Part 9 of the study covering Gifu Prefecture, providing summary analytical tables and the initial roster of prefectural colleges and secondary schools.",
