   "start_page": 68,
   "summary": "This section concludes the report on educational institutions in Kagawa Prefecture as of April and November 1946. It provides detailed institutional rosters covering municipal and village elementary schools and kindergartens, private secondary and vocational schools, youth schools, and institutions operated under ministries other than the Ministry of Education. Each entry lists school names, locations, founding dates, student enrollment figures, and teaching staff classified by sex and employment status, concluding with a prefectural map of Shikoku.",
   "title": "Roster and Statistics of Japanese Educational Institutions, April and November 1946: Kagawa Prefecture",
