   "summary": "This document constitutes the first portion of Special Report AR-302-E-A-26-9 on educational institutions in Gifu Prefecture as of April and November 1946. It includes an introductory overview of the Japanese educational structure, summary statistical tables analyzing institutions across various administrative jurisdictions, and the opening section of the detailed school roster. The roster pages record higher education colleges, normal schools, and prefectural secondary schools, detailing foundation dates, student enrollments, and teacher counts.",
